WEBVTT

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:12.660
Who are you?

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.700
Reiji Akaba.

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:19.600
I'm the president of Leo Corporation.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.900
Reiji Akaba.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:27.090
Since Leo Corporation controls LDS,

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:31.910
you assaulted people in Maiami 
City affiliated with LDS

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:34.650
because you wanted to meet me.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.080
Am I correct?

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:41.240
So you're Reiji Akaba.

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:44.200
Leo Akaba's son.

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:46.300
I was waiting for this moment!

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:47.490
Bring it on!

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.780
Duel me!

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:52.680
I want to ask you something first.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:56.600
Why do you want to battle me?

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:59.100
I don't have to answer you!

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:02.070
In order to rescue your friend, right?

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:07.550
According to that girl you defeated,

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:11.580
this is what you said the 
last time she saw you:

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:13.320
Ruri?

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:16.560
Why are you here, Ruri?

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:20.060
Did you escape by yourself?

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:28.020
I'm guessing that Ruri is a dear 
friend for you - no, for both of you.

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:32.140
And that your enemies took her.

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:37.480
And Ruri still hasn't escaped 
from your enemy's clutches.

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:41.960
That's why you continue to assault LDS.

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:48.560
She's not Ruri.

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:53.520
I saw her studying Fusion 
Summon with my own eyes.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:58.280
Ruri is our teammate and your younger sister.

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:04.100
She'd never happily study the 
enemy's summoning method.

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:12.840
I have no doubt that our 
enemy still has Ruri.

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:14.820
But I promise to rescue her.

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:19.560
In order to do that, I need you!

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:21.200
I see.

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:26.190
You need me for a hostage exchange.

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:27.640
Exactly.

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:33.640
I kept attacking LDS and sent you 
cards with souls trapped inside

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:35.930
so that I could draw you out.

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:41.720
Even Leo Akaba won't say 
no in exchange for his son!

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:43.910
I wouldn't be so sure.

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:45.160
What?

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:50.150
I don't think he cares about me.

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:51.940
What do you mean?

00:02:52.180 --> 00:02:53.390
Well, whatever.

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:57.300
If you want to battle, I'm willing to accept.

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:59.630
But I have one condition.

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:01.380
Condition?

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:08.900
If you accept the condition and execute 
it, then I will happily be your opponent.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:12.600
And if you win...

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.480
You can do whatever you like.

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:17.640
Hey!

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:29.190
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:34.040
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:37.060
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:41.370
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:03:57.060 --> 00:04:00.150
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:03.560
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:12.300
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:16.870
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:19.070
Impulse  Got it got it

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:24.280
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:35.040
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:41.960
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:45.900
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:49.300
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:59.580
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:02.920
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:12.960
Immovable Determination!!  Noboru Gongenzaka

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:26.070
Where's Masumi?

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:52.430
You've shown growth in your three 
matches, just as I expected.

00:05:53.170 --> 00:05:57.200
In your first match, you learned 
that cooking nor dueling is perfect.

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:01.320
You used flexible thinking 
and adapted to the situation

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:04.520
to give the best hospitality.

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:09.310
In your second match, you learned that 
satisfying yourself isn't enough in dueling.

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:14.990
Communicating with both the opponent 
and the crowd are important.

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:20.860
In your third match, you finally 
showed wonder and passion

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:24.440
that exceeded my and the 
audience's expectations.

00:06:26.470 --> 00:06:28.640
You have a perfect score so far.

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:31.340
But your next match is important!

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:35.940
It's the final battle in the 
four matches that I produced!

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:39.900
Yuya, this is your 50th match this year!

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:44.200
If you win, you'll have 30 wins 
in 50 matches for a 60% win rate.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:47.660
You'll be allowed to enter the 
Junior Youth Championship.

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:52.260
In this important match, show me 
everything you learned so far!

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:56.380
And take your first step 
towards becoming a pro!

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:01.940
My future will be determined today.

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:05.440
No matter who my opponent is, 
I have to believe in myself

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:09.460
and do my entertainment dueling!

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:13.150
But I'll eat my mom's pancakes first!

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:17.480
For good luck, I want thirty 
pancakes for my thirtieth victory!

00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:18.600
Huh?

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:20.100
Mom?

00:07:22.090 --> 00:07:25.580
Mom?

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:27.580
Huh?

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:29.660
En!

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:31.100
Core!

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:35.760
Even Sora isn't here.

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:38.600
Where did everyone go?

00:07:43.720 --> 00:07:45.300
Sheesh.

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:49.310
Today's important.  Your son finds out

00:07:49.310 --> 00:07:51.950
if he can take his first 
step towards becoming a pro.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:54.060
No breakfast from Mom...

00:07:55.150 --> 00:07:56.840
The principal isn't here.

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.260
Where's Yuzu?

00:07:58.260 --> 00:08:00.460
Why are you hiding?

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:03.820
Come out, Ayu!

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:05.880
Futoshi!  Tatsuya!

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:10.470
There's no one at home or at school.

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:12.480
What happened?

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:14.840
Yes, what has happened?

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:16.560
Nico!

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:19.460
Yes.  Good morning, Yuya.

00:08:19.700 --> 00:08:21.710
Were you able to sleep last night?

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:23.920
Forget that.  Where's everyone?

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:25.240
Does that worry you?

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:27.500
It does!  Where is everyone?

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:29.480
Oh my, look at the time!

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.690
We'll be late if we don't hurry.

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.580
Let's go.

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:35.860
Wait!  Answer me!

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:38.040
Where did everyone go?

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:49.840
Gongenzaka Dojo

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:52.500
My fourth opponent is here?

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:54.080
Don't tell me it's...

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:57.720
Find out for yourself.

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:01.050
I was getting tired of waiting, Yuya!

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:06.120
Why do I have to duel Gongenzaka?

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:08.640
I've dueled him many times before.

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:10.980
It's true that you've dueled him many times.

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:14.030
But you two have never had a serious match.

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:20.080
I know that you two are friends.

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:27.450
When your father Yusyo Sakaki vanished 
before the championship match,

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:34.440
Gongenzaka defended you 
against everyone's ridicule.

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:38.240
Such beautiful friendship touched me deeply.

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:42.550
But even if you're best friends, 
that doesn't matter in a match!

00:09:42.550 --> 00:09:45.000
It's even more true if 
you want to become a pro!

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:46.920
Exactly, Yuya!

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:51.450
We've battled many times before.

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:54.640
But they were never serious!

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:58.270
Since you were hurt by your 
father's disappearance,

00:09:58.270 --> 00:10:00.580
I could never duel you wholeheartedly.

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:07.920
But I've realized that my compassion 
has weakened my passion!

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:10.590
Weakened you?

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:15.020
With one win and one loss,

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:17.780
the third match between Yusho School 
and LDS was the deciding match.

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:20.130
I wasn't able to win.

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:23.160
But you had a tie!

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:26.220
I couldn't win because my heart was weak.

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:30.040
I was too lenient in the match!

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:34.660
To make sure it doesn't happen again, 
I must pressure myself even more!

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:41.660
That's why Gongenzaka is 
also risking his entrance

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:44.560
into the Junior Youth 
Championship in this duel.

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:48.730
He only needed one more 
win to get a 60% win rate,

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:56.030
but he didn't accept any other 
challenges and waited for you, Yuya.

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:57.500
What?

00:10:57.820 --> 00:11:02.850
Yuya, you also need one more 
win to enter the championship.

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:07.980
In other words, only the person who wins 
this match can enter the tournament.

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:10.650
Why are you going this far?

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:16.420
If I didn't, I couldn't have 
a serious match with you.

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:20.350
Since I'm this dojo's successor,

00:11:20.350 --> 00:11:23.980
this battle will be a test in 
mastering the Immovable Duel!

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:28.680
Since you're my friend, I'll abandon 
compassion and defeat you with all my power!

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:30.670
Prepare yourself, Yuya!

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:45.640
Look.  It's that coward's kid.

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:48.500
Yeah, the coward Yusyo Sakaki's kid.

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:51.160
He was at the stadium.

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:54.950
He said that he was going 
to duel in his dad's place.

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:16.020
If you're going to duel in your dad's 
place, I'll duel for Strong Ishijima.

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:18.440
Let's duel.

00:12:19.780 --> 00:12:22.340
Well?  You don't wanna?

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:24.960
Are you going to run away like your dad?

00:12:25.150 --> 00:12:28.080
You're a pathetic coward.

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:30.260
Stop it!

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:37.400
The man Gongenzaka won't 
allow you to bully the weak!

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:42.040
You're breaking Gongenzaka 
Dojo's ironclad rules!

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:43.900
I'm not bullying him.

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:47.640
I only invited him to duel.

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:50.320
Yusyo Sakaki or Strong Ishijima:

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:54.240
We'll find out who's stronger 
by dueling in their places.

00:12:54.240 --> 00:12:59.630
My dojo isn't teaching you the Immovable 
Duel so that you could do things like that!

00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:03.340
If you battle unnecessarily, 
you're expelled immediately!

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:06.600
I won't overlook that even if 
you're my senior classmate!

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:08.620
Gongenzaka...

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:13.570
It seems you haven't accepted 
the situation yet, Yuya.

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:15.450
But that's only natural.

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:19.540
You can't enter the Junior Youth Championship

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:22.860
without kicking down your protector.

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:27.490
Where is everyone at this important moment?

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:32.460
If you want to become a pro, 
you must become stronger solo.

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:38.950
Gongenzaka wasn't the only one who protected 
you until now.  There were many others.

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:44.270
Their cheers and encouragement 
gave you strength.

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:49.600
But a pro must unleash his 
strength even in away games

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:52.700
where everyone supports the opponent.

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:59.690
That's why I banned your 
cheering squad today.

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:07.480
They will have their 
first-ever serious match.

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:08.630
Do your best.

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:10.300
Yuya...

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:15.620
Shall we begin, Master Gongenzaka?

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:21.680
A duel not only polishes the soul, but it 
cultivates your character through hard work.

00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:25.240
By developing an immovable 
soul that never moves.

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:29.040
Gongenzaka Dojo travels this path.

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:34.020
By clashing head-on fair 
and square in this battle,

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:37.720
I want you to polish your souls even more.

00:14:38.360 --> 00:14:39.640
Now!

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:42.120
Action Field on!

00:14:42.120 --> 00:14:45.430
I activate the Field Spell Sword Cemetery!

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:55.540
This is...

00:14:55.940 --> 00:14:56.840
Yes.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:15:01.580
I battled on this same field against LDS.

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:04.820
Why here?  Did you choose it?

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:07.660
Yeah.  You'll soon find out why.

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:08.320
Here we go!

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:21.100
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:23.870
Along with their monsters, they'll kick 
the ground and fly through the sky...

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:25.620
...to move around the field!

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:26.260
Witness...

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:28.870
...dueling's greatest evolution!

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:30.910
Action!

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:32.510
Duel!

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:40.920
I'll go first!

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:44.560
I summon Superheavy Samurai 
Flutist from my hand!

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:52.330
On the turn that this card is summoned,

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:56.000
I can tribute it to Special 
Summon a Superheavy Samurai!

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:04.560
I Special Summon Superheavy Samurai 
Big Benkei in defense position!

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:07.910
I end my turn!

00:16:07.910 --> 00:16:10.600
He already brought out a Level 8 monster!

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:13.120
Gon is going full throttle from the start.

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:15.020
He's in super serious mode.

00:16:15.020 --> 00:16:19.630
Entry into the Junior Youth Championship 
is on the line in this match.

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:23.260
I want Gongenzaka to win because 
he takes good care of us,

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:26.800
but I also want Yuya to 
win for You Show School.

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:28.330
What should I do-

00:16:30.560 --> 00:16:33.340
Be quiet!  Stop yelling!

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:35.470
What if Yuya hears you?

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:36.950
That's right!

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:40.980
Nico told us to stay here and remain quiet.

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:42.250
I'm sorry.

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:46.020
How will Yuya respond to 
Gon's fighting spirit?

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:48.220
I'm looking forward to it!

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:52.880
Why does Gongenzaka have to be my 
opponent for this crucial fourth match?

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:56.660
It's thanks to him that 
I've made it this far.

00:16:57.520 --> 00:17:01.630
I was able to duel almost 
fifty matches this year

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:06.020
because he introduced me 
to his dojo's students.

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:11.010
I have to defeat my supporter so that 
only I can enter the tournament?

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:16.080
Too much compassion is the same 
as insulting your opponent!

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:22.520
Yuya, I told you that I'm going 
to defeat you with all my strength

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:24.880
because you're my friend!

00:17:25.050 --> 00:17:28.860
There's no need for pity!  Come 
at me with all your strength!

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:34.200
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:36.670 --> 00:17:39.500
I summon Performapal Silver Claw!

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:48.500
Let's go, Silver Claw!

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:53.350
This is...

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:56.780
I activate the Action Card Extreme Sword!

00:17:56.780 --> 00:18:01.060
Silver Claw gains 1000 attack 
points during battle.

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:06.300
I can use this too!

00:18:06.300 --> 00:18:08.980
I activate the Action Card Over Sword!

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:13.740
Silver Claw gains 500 attack 
points during battle!

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:16.900
He's running around getting Action Cards.

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:18.480
He's on the attack.

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:21.820
Yeah!  This is how Yuya always duels!

00:18:21.820 --> 00:18:24.180
Like always, I'm getting shivers!

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:30.520
Even though he powered it up, Silver 
Claw only has 3300 attack points.

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:34.390
It's not enough against Big 
Benkei's 3500 defense points.

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:40.730
Let's battle!  Silver 
Claw, attack Big Benkei!

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:45.160
Silver Claw's effect activates!

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:49.440
It gains 300 attack points 
until the end of battle!

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:51.660
It's stronger than Big Benkei!

00:18:51.660 --> 00:18:53.380
It can destroy it!

00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:55.180
I'm full of shivers!

00:18:57.940 --> 00:19:04.090
By sending Superheavy Samurai Soulfire 
Suit from my hand to the graveyard,

00:19:04.510 --> 00:19:06.560
I can activate its effect!

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:10.700
It negates Big Benkei's destruction!

00:19:12.530 --> 00:19:19.040
When this effect negates destruction, 
Big Benkei loses 800 defense points.

00:19:21.380 --> 00:19:23.070
At the end of battle,

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:26.860
the two Action Cards and 
Silver Claw's effects end,

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:28.710
so its attack points return to normal.

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:34.660
This isn't a battle I can win half-heartedly.

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:41.090
I set one card and end my turn!

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:44.980
Yuya attacks while Gongenzaka defends.

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:48.560
The beginning is what we expected.

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:49.800
Correct.

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:52.280
No matter how much the opponent moves around,

00:19:52.280 --> 00:19:55.410
he isn't deceived and remains 
in an immovable stance.

00:19:55.660 --> 00:20:00.260
This is Gongenzaka Dojo's 
noble path of fighting.

00:20:00.260 --> 00:20:01.380
Well done, Noboru!

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:04.120
This is why you're my dojo's successor!

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:09.360
Use your Immovable Duel to win 
the Junior Youth Championship!

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:12.540
You're being hasty, Father.

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:15.020
The battle has only begun.

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:18.700
I haven't shown my full strength yet!

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:21.200
Gongenzaka...

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:24.770
Here I go!  My turn!

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:28.940
I drew it!

00:20:29.480 --> 00:20:33.310
In order to defeat his friend,

00:20:33.310 --> 00:20:35.700
the man Gongenzaka has decided 
to break his own shell!

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:39.100
Watch, Father!

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:43.160
This is the new Immovable 
Duel that I'm pursuing!

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:49.060
I summon the Level 2 Tuner Monster 
Superheavy Samurai Trumpeter!

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:55.980
Tuner Monster?

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:57.280
Is Gon actually going to...

00:20:57.280 --> 00:20:58.900
Synchro Summon?

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:00.240
No way!

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:07.120
Level 2 Superheavy Samurai Trumpeter tunes 
Level 8 Superheavy Samurai Big Benkei!

00:21:14.860 --> 00:21:19.500
Malevolent god, along with the 
roar of a thousand blades,

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:22.560
appear on the field in a whirling sandstorm!

00:21:22.560 --> 00:21:24.260
Synchro Summon!

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:29.900
Arrive on the front lines, Level 10 
Superheavy Samurai Warlord Susanowo!

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:38.810
Gongenzaka Synchro Summoned.

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:40.500
Oh my!

00:21:42.310 --> 00:21:43.700
He really...

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:45.060
...did it.

00:21:45.060 --> 00:21:48.290
Is this why he chose this field?

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:51.050
Yuya...

00:21:53.940 --> 00:21:55.560
Here I go, Yuya.

00:21:55.560 --> 00:21:58.400
The real match now begins!

00:21:58.980 --> 00:22:00.270
Prepare yourself!

00:22:12.530 --> 00:22:18.010
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:18.230 --> 00:22:27.490
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:34.380 --> 00:22:39.500
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:39.760 --> 00:22:44.740
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:45.030 --> 00:22:50.180
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:50.430 --> 00:22:55.410
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:55.640 --> 00:23:01.040
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:01.040 --> 00:23:05.460
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:11.430
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:11.430 --> 00:23:16.840
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:16.840 --> 00:23:22.140
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:22.140 --> 00:23:31.480
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:32.510 --> 00:23:39.730
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:45.500 --> 00:23:48.900
Gongenzaka Synchro Summoned!

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:53.400
This is the new Immovable Duel 
achieved through my training!

00:23:53.400 --> 00:23:58.100
The real match now begins!  Prepare yourself!

00:23:58.100 --> 00:24:04.100
I need to think of a new 
way to summon Rune-Eyes.

00:24:04.760 --> 00:24:10.550
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
New Territory  Superheavy Samurai Warlord Susanowo

00:24:10.550 --> 00:24:12.950
The fun is only getting started!
